e session learned.","sameAs":["https://github.com/gethrbr","https://www.linkedin.com/company/getharbor"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"sales","email":"hello@gethrbr.com","url":"https://gethrbr.com/contact","availableLanguage":["English"]},{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"privacy","email":"privacy@gethrbr.com","url":"https://gethrbr.com/legal/privacy"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://gethrbr.com/#website","url":"https://gethrbr.com","name":"Harbor","description":"One company brain for every person and every agent.","publisher":{"@id":"https://gethrbr.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en"},{"@type":"SoftwareApplication","@id":"https://gethrbr.com/#software","name":"Harbor","url":"https://gethrbr.com","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","applicationSubCategory":"Developer Tools","operatingSystem":"Web Browser","publisher":{"@id":"https://gethrbr.com/#organization"},"description":"Harbor serves every agent what your team decided. One company brain for every agent your team runs: it reads your Slack, repos and docs, injects only what applies to the task on turn one, writes back what the session learned, and counts which of your rules the answers actually cited.","featureList":["Reads Slack, GitHub, Linear, Notion, Granola and Google Drive continuously, with no document to write","Hands each agent only the facts and skills that fit the task, instead of the whole rulebook","Works through a CLI, an MCP server, /harbor in Slack and a web app","Wires Claude Code, Cursor and Codex with one command, npx harborloop init","Watches a risky command first, then blocks it before an agent runs it once you set the rule to block","You set the gate: choose which learnings wait for a person, and each one waits with the thread it came from","Flags a rule when it stops being true","Counts how often each rule was served to an agent, and how often an answer cited it"],"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","@id":"https://gethrbr.com/pricing#free","name":"Free","